      ],
      "text": "The project is described as a collection of 16 specialized AI coding agents, each designed around a Myers-Briggs personality type to offer distinct approaches to software development challenges."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_43256bd1a511301b6a167572c49d2680c08d862ae148eefa9f82cadc45baf3cb",
